WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Blue guard sparks show Bison blocking Ryu’s gold OD uppercut.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.050
Standing heavy kick punishes the blocked reversal.

3
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.850
Medium Scissors reaches the already mined Ryu.

4
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.200
Jumping medium punches juggle the mine launch.

5
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.100
Heavy Backfist Combo replants the mine.
